IMPORT prelude

-- Korea: Framework Act on the Development of Artificial Intelligence and
-- Establishment of Trust (인공지능 발전과 신뢰 기반 조성 등에 관한 기본법),
-- Act No. 20676 of 2025, as amended by Act No. 21311 of 2026, with its
-- Enforcement Decree (시행령) and the Decree's Annex 2.
--
-- THE DOMAIN MODULE: nouns only. Every other module imports it.
-- A DRAFT. Not for use as advice. No domain expert and no lawyer qualified in
-- Korea has read this encoding against the source.
--
-- SEAT: an AI business operator (인공지능사업자, Act Art 2(7)): a company,
-- association, individual or state body that develops and provides AI, or
-- provides AI products or services using AI a developer provided. Officials
-- (the Minister of Science and ICT) have no seat; their powers appear only as
-- what they mean for the operator.
--
-- Identifiers are English; the Korean behind each fact is in the comment above
-- it. The English renderings of the Korean are the encoder's own; no official
-- English text was deposited.

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- 1. Facts the operator can state about itself
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

-- Act Art 2(7): "인공지능사업자"란 인공지능산업과 관련된 사업을 하는 자로서
-- 다음 각 목의 어느 하나에 해당하는 ... 가. 인공지능개발사업자: 인공지능을
-- 개발하여 제공하는 자 / 나. 인공지능이용사업자: 가목의 사업자가 제공한
-- 인공지능을 이용하여 인공지능제품 또는 인공지능서비스를 제공하는 자.
-- Act Art 36(1): 국내에 주소 또는 영업소가 없는 인공지능사업자.
-- Act Art 4(1): 국외에서 이루어진 행위라도 국내 시장 또는 이용자에게 영향을
-- 미치는 경우.
-- Act Art 4(2) with Decree Art 2: AI developed and used only to perform the
-- defence or national-security tasks the Decree lists, as designated by the
-- Minister of National Defense or the Director of the National Intelligence
-- Service.
DECLARE `The operator` HAS
    `carries on a business related to the AI industry` IS A BOOLEAN
    `develops AI and provides it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `provides AI products or services using AI that a developer provided` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has an address or a business office in Korea` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the conduct takes place in Korea` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the conduct affects the Korean market or users in Korea` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the AI is developed and used only for tasks Decree Article 2 lists` IS A BOOLEAN

-- Decree Art 29(1): the four criteria for a domestic representative.
-- Revenue is in Korean won, converted at the previous year's (or previous
-- business year's) average exchange rate (Decree Art 29(2)); the operator states
-- the converted figure. Users are the average daily number of users in Korea of
-- the operator's AI products and AI services over the three months before the
-- end of the previous year.
DECLARE `The operator's scale` HAS
    `total revenue in the previous year, in won` IS A NUMBER
    `revenue from AI services in the previous year, in won` IS A NUMBER
    `average daily users in Korea over the last three months of the previous year` IS A NUMBER
    `has been fined under Article 43(1) item 3` IS A BOOLEAN

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- 2. Facts the operator can state about one AI system
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

-- Act Art 32(1) and Decree Art 24(1), whose three criteria must all be met
-- (모두 충족). Item 1 is a number of floating-point operations; the method of
-- counting it is left to a notice of the Minister (Decree Art 24(2)) that
-- law.go.kr lists as not made (fork F3). Items 2 and 3 are judgements the text
-- does not hand to anyone in particular; they are asked as facts (fork F4).
DECLARE `The AI system` HAS
    `cumulative compute used in training, in floating-point operations` IS A NUMBER
    `is built and run with the most advanced AI technology now used in AI systems` IS A BOOLEAN
    `its risk may have a broad and serious effect on human life, physical safety and fundamental rights` IS A BOOLEAN

-- Act Art 31(1) and Decree Art 23(4) items 1 and 2: one product or service.
DECLARE `The product or service` HAS
    `uses high-impact AI` IS A BOOLEAN
    `uses generative AI` IS A BOOLEAN
    `that it uses such AI is obvious from its name, screen, surface or output` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is used only for the operator's internal business` IS A BOOLEAN

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- 3. Provisions and violations the operator may be asked about
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

-- The provisions of the Act that impose a duty on an AI business operator,
-- named by number. Article 40(1) lists five of them.
DECLARE `Duty provision` IS ONE OF
    `Article 31(1), prior notice to users`
    `Article 31(2), marking generative AI output`
    `Article 31(3), notice or marking of realistic synthetic output`
    `Article 32(1), the safety measures`
    `Article 32(2), submitting the results to the Minister`
    `Article 33(1), reviewing whether AI is high-impact`
    `Article 34(1), measures for high-impact AI`
    `Article 36(1), designating a domestic representative`

-- Act Art 43(1) items 1 to 3: the only three failures the Act fines.
DECLARE `Finable failure` IS ONE OF
    `Article 43(1) item 1: not giving the prior notice Article 31(1) requires`
    `Article 43(1) item 2: not designating a domestic representative as Article 36(1) requires`
    `Article 43(1) item 3: not carrying out a suspension or corrective order under Article 40(3)`

-- Decree Annex 2, general criteria 가 and 나: the order of the violation counts
-- only fines imposed for the same violation in the two years before it was
-- detected. The operator states the order of the highest such earlier fine:
-- 0 for none, 1 for a first, 2 for a second, 3 for a third or later.
DECLARE `The violation` HAS
    `failure` IS A `Finable failure`
    `order of the highest fine for the same violation in the previous two years` IS A NUMBER
    `the operator is in arrears with a fine` IS A BOOLEAN
